# Pass 1 review evidence. Written by scripts/review-capture.sh into the worktree root,
# handed to the other two review passes, and never committed -- it is a snapshot of one
# machine at one moment, not a project artifact. Tracks A-D all left theirs untracked;
# this rule makes that the default rather than a thing each track has to remember.
review-capture-*.md
